    ],
    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests for {@link RandomUtils}. <p> Every behaviour is exercised twice: </p> <ul> <li>via the deprecated {@code static} façade methods (for example {@link RandomUtils#nextInt(int, int)}), covered by the plain {@link Test} methods; and</li> <li>via the instance methods (for example {@code randomInt(int, int)}) on each of the three singletons returned by {@link RandomUtils#secure()}, {@link RandomUtils#secureStrong()} and {@link RandomUtils#insecure()}, covered by the {@link ParameterizedTest} methods fed by {@link #randomProvider()}.</li> </ul>"
   },
